      "text": "Wellton Station agents worked with Yuma Air Branch pilots to locate and arrest three Mexican nationals who illegally entered the U.S. through the #sonorandesert east of Yuma last week. All three will be charged with illegal entry under 8 USC 1325 and alien inadmissibility under 8 USC 1182, with two also being charged with reentry after removal under 8 USC 1326. They face up to two years in prison before they are removed from the U.S. #YumaSector #onpatrol #BorderSecurityIsNationalSecurity",
